# platformd-verifyd presence-verification stack.
#
# platformd-verifyd runs only the auth phase of this stack to prove a user is
# present. List the factors you want offered; the first to succeed verifies
# presence. The factors below are agent-free — the device is the prompt — so no
# UI is needed. A password factor would need the prompt agent and is intentionally
# not enabled here.
#
# Enrol a fingerprint with `fprintd-enroll` before relying on pam_fprintd.

auth       sufficient   pam_fprintd.so
#auth      sufficient   pam_howdy.so      # face; presence-grade on a non-IR camera
#auth      sufficient   pam_u2f.so        # security key (cue=yes for a touch prompt)
auth       required     pam_deny.so

account    required     pam_permit.so
